1
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:11,940
Tinku bhaiya, it's so cold! My nose has turned into ice!

2
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:15,655
And look at this fog! We can't see anything ahead.

3
00:00:16,155 --> 00:00:19,355
I can only see these hot, hot jalebis!

4
00:00:19,855 --> 00:00:22,885
They're for Dadi, Golu! Don't eat them on the way.

5
00:00:23,285 --> 00:00:24,805
Just one... a tiny one...

6
00:00:25,305 --> 00:00:25,905
Woof! Woof!

7
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:28,760
Moti, what happened? Who are you barking at?

8
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,760
Meeee-ooow...

9
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,970
Wh-what's that? Something HUGE in the fog...

10
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:37,785
A ghost! A giant ghost!

11
00:00:38,185 --> 00:00:40,645
It even has glowing eyes!

12
00:00:40,945 --> 00:00:41,925
Woof! Woof! Woof!

13
00:00:43,225 --> 00:00:45,670
Bhaiya, it's come to eat our jalebis!

14
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:48,140
Shhh! Hide behind the wall!

15
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:52,400
Why is the ghost so big? It's as tall as a tree!

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,285
Wait... when it moves, it goes all blurry.

17
00:00:56,785 --> 00:01:01,000
It's a shadow on the fog! From in front of the streetlight!

18
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,135
A shadow? A ghost's shadow?

19
00:01:03,635 --> 00:01:06,930
Let's switch on the torch and see who it really is.

20
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:11,355
Hey! It's just a tiny kitten!

21
00:01:11,655 --> 00:01:12,155
Meow!

22
00:01:12,655 --> 00:01:16,255
It's Dadi's kitten, Barfi! All covered in flour!

23
00:01:16,755 --> 00:01:19,515
Such a tiny kitten... and such a big shadow?

24
00:01:20,015 --> 00:01:24,465
When something small is close to a light, its shadow gets really big!

25
00:01:24,865 --> 00:01:29,370
And a cat's eyes shine in the light. That's why they looked spooky!

26
00:01:29,970 --> 00:01:32,760
Barfi, you jumped into the flour tin, didn't you?

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,180
Meow! Meow!

28
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:38,005
Look, she followed the smell of the jalebis!

29
00:01:39,605 --> 00:01:42,405
Come on Barfi, let's take you to Dadi.

30
00:01:44,205 --> 00:01:47,210
Oh no! Barfi shook all the flour onto Moti!

31
00:01:47,610 --> 00:01:50,410
Ha ha! Now Moti is a snowy puppy!

32
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:50,930
Woof!

33
00:01:51,530 --> 00:01:53,635
And the ghost's jalebi... can I eat it?

34
00:01:53,935 --> 00:01:54,715
Golu!

35
00:01:55,915 --> 00:02:00,735
Next time: who's jingling on Nani's roof at midnight?!

36
00:02:01,235 --> 00:02:02,550
Bye-bye, friends!

37
00:02:02,850 --> 00:02:03,840
Bye-bye!
